from the sound, then return them to it. The sonic  \nadventure is thus an adventure of departure and a return, a loss of self\n  and a rediscovery of self through sound.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/","radiaseason":"27","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;CFRC","title":"Show 0353: Suono Fuga by Annie Dunsford (CFRC)","publicdate":"2017-05-02 05:36:57","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2017-05-02 05:36:57","date":"2012-01-02","creator":"CFRC","backup_location":"ia906403_13"},"server":"ia601506.us.archive.org","uniq":1360107876,"workable_servers":["ia601506.us.archive.org","ia801506.us.archive.org"]}